WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:55.300
Lief and his friends have stepped foot into Sorceress Thaegan's lands, encountering the mysterious giant.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:03:02.500
They succeeded in breaking Thaegan's curse by answering the giant's riddles.

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:12.400
Then, out of concern for Kree's safety, Jasmine parts ways with him, choosing to continue her journey with Lief and Barda.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:22.400
During their travels, they rescued a Ralad man
who was captured by the Grey Guards, landing Lief and his friends into trouble.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.800
At this rate, they'll either catch up to us or we'll be shot.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.200
What?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.200
You...!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.800
Filli, let's go!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.000
Not bad!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.100
I guess.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.400
Crap!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:16.500
Going along this path is basically setting ourselves up to be shot!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.150
Let's go over here!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.000
Look, plums!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.250
They smell sweet.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.700
We don't have time to eat!

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.200
Look! They're not following us anymore.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:44.800
What?

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:55.500
My mother showed me how to make this medicine. It works really well.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.100
You don't need to thank me.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.600
We can't relax yet.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.050
Let's search the area.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.300
You can just wait here.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.650
We'll be right back.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.500
The Grey Guards aren't around.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.450
Yeah...

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.600
There's a house!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.000
In a place like this?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.600
What's wrong, Filli?

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.150
What's this?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.250
Ring...and...enter?

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.300
You mean ring this bell?

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.900
Someone's there!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:22.700
Oh, it's just an old man and woman living here.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.000
Let's ask them for directions.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.100
Hey, wait!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.150
Hey...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.100
We're sinking!

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.000
Grab onto this!

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.500
Grabbing on to something like that won't stop us from sinking!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.300
We're saved!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.700
It's the people from that house!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.700
Evila meht tog ew!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.400
Tsaef a s'ti!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:14.050
I have no idea what they're saying.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.300
That's not a language I've heard before.

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.700
Will they understand us if we thank them?

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.200
Thank you very much!

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:26.300
Filli?

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.600
What's going on with you?

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.350
They seem like nice people.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.450
But, we followed the sign and rang the bell

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.550
And we almost sank in.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.000
But the sign was half broken, remember?

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.350
I get it!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.000
That half of the sign said:

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.100
That's what it said.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.950
Why would they let the sign stay broken?

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.700
They probably didn't think anyone would come here.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.350
Nij.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.300
Doj.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.900
I'm Lief.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.300
And this is Barda and Jasmine.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.700
And that's Filli.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.700
Ni emoc.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.100
Retne.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.050
Ni emoc.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.600
Retne.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.750
What should we do?

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.550
Let's go in and dry our clothes.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:23.850
Wait. I don't want to go in.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.400
Filli is so scared...

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.900
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.100
Edisni emoc!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.110
Emoc!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.900
These people saved us, Jasmine.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:38.350
The Ralad man is waiting for us, so let's go back!

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:41.400
Okay, after we get some food, we'll go straight back.

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:03.850
Stoidi ouy.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.000
Ereh revo.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.350
O-Okay.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.250
So warm!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.480
It sure is.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.900
Hey... there are no windows in this house.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.600
Oh, there's one up there.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.000
Somehow I can't relax in this house.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.750
Once our clothes are dry, let's get out of here.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.650
Ereh.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.700
Yojne.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.300
It's because he's scared.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.750
Jasmine.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.200
They're nice people.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:57.900
It's kind people like them who deserve to see peace in Deltora restored.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.900
Lief, is the belt safe?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.940
Is the topaz still there?

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.000
Yeah.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.050
What in the world is going on?

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:48.900
What... is happening here?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.800
Here.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.500
Hurry and drink.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.700
Evila meht tog ew!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.300
Tsaef a sti!

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.750
Evila meht tog ew...

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.450
We got them alive...

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.400
Tsaef a sti...

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.400
It's a feast...?

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.200
They're speaking backwards!

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:28.200
Why am I only now seeing the truth?

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.800
That's right!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.000
Earlier, I touched my belt!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:40.250
<i>According to the Book of Deltora, the topaz protects the wearer from the fear of darkness,</i>

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:44.450
<i>Strengthens one's spirit and allows them to see the truth.</i>

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.650
You'll all soon be sleeping eternally.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.250
I want to eat them all right now.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.300
What idiots they are.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.600
Don't drink that!

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:15.500
What are you doing?!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.200
They'd specially prepared...

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.700
Barda?!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:27.200
What's wrong, Barda?!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.400
Barda?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.200
Barda, wake up! Barda!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.400
Something was in the drink!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:33.700
I know!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.400
H-Hey! What are you...!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.300
What is this place...?

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.600
Could this be...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.250
Soon we'll be eating delicious food.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.950
It's been quite a while since we've had human meat!

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:08.100
Mother will want some too.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.400
Cooking delicious stew...

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.300
Those two... are going to eat us!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.600
This can't be...

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.250
Who are they...?

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.000
Nij... Doj...

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.800
If you read them backwards, it's Jin and Jod!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.700
<i>"Sorceress Thaegan gulps her favourite food,</i>

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.200
<i>In her cave with all her brood."</i>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.800
<i>"And the names of her children are,</i>

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.700
<i>Hot, Tot, Jin,</i>

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:35.800
<i>Jod..."</i>

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:41.500
They're Jin and Jod, Sorceress Thaegan's children!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:47.800
I thought it was strange that the Grey Guards stopped chasing us after we had lost them.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.500
Now it all makes sense!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:53.500
They knew where we were running to!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:58.750
They knew that in this place, we would get stuck in the swamp and get caught by Thaegan's children!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.200
Let's get out of here quickly.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:07.700
I see. The window is high up so no one can escape...

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.900
That means to get outside, we have to go through the kitchen they're in.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.980
Maybe that's a door!

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:23.800
Well? Does it look like we can get out from here?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.000
This is...

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.550
These are the belongings of all the
people those two have tricked and killed!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.200
Looks like they drank the tea.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.200
They're sleeping soundly.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.500
What should we do?

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.600
Our only option is to go through the kitchen.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.700
Are you saying you want to fight Thaegan's children?!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.600
It's better than doing nothing and being eaten!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.720
But Barda isn't stable!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.000
Just leave me behind...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.000
We can't do something like that!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.400
Someone's come.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.400
Let's get out of here while those two are distracted!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.500
Sorry, Lief.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.650
It's fine.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.600
Lief!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.900
It's him!

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.600
Stay away, don't come here! You'll sink if you go further!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:51.700
Lief!

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.100
They were pretending to be asleep!

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.700
We've been fooled!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:03.850
We're surrounded by the swamp.

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.700
It's useless!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:09.700
There must be times when they cross the swamp too.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:12.300
There must be a way to get over there...!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:16.500
Our precious meal!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.000
We're going to kill you!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.200
What was that?!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.500
It's the Ralad man!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.250
He didn't run away?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.700
You bastard!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.400
Stop interfering!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.000
You're not covered in mud at all.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.000
How did you get across the swamp?

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:55.700
What's this?

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.700
It looks like we can get across by following this path.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.300
There must have been a button over there too!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:08.400
You came all this way to show us this and save us!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:13.000
Those two are coming.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.400
Even if we can get across the swamp, how do we escape from them...?

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.450
There's a button on the other side too!

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.600
After we cross, we can erase the path!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.500
So we're going to make them fall into the swamp!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.950
Jasmine, go on ahead!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.600
Lief, you go as well.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.850
Barda, I can't!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.900
I'm able to move a little bit.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.050
Barda!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:58.800
As you'd expect of a race of carpenters; he's strong!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.400
How's that?!

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:04.600
Do you really think our current strength is all we've got?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.550
Your underestimation is troublesome...

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.450
You're not getting away!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:28.050
Time to eat our meal!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.850
Lief! Hurry over here!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.750
Trying to remove the bridge, are you?!

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.200
Jasmine!

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:44.900
Jasmine!

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.700
What are you doing?! Go away!

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:51.600
Kree!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.600
Lief! Now's your chance!

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.300
Damned bird!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.400
Get out of my way!

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:18.700
Kree!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.700
Kree...

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:22.700
Jasmine!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.400
I'm fine.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.550
You didn't go home after all?

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.150
You're so stubborn.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.700
Geez...

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.700
Here, I'll give you some nectar from the Lilies of Life.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.150
Thank goodness.

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:58.300
I'll put some on you too, Jasmine.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.750
I have to save this.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:02.800
For me...

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.100
This ointment will be enough.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.910
Thanks.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:21.400
Barda, how are you feeling?

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.850
I'm fine now.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:25.100
This is...?

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:27.500
It's Ralad writing.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.000
His name is Manus.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:31.900
Manus?

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:38.530
Before he was caught by the Grey Guards, it seems like he was forced to work for Jin and Jod.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.800
That place, huh?

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:44.030
That's why he knew about the path.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.900
He wants to thank us.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:51.200
"You have saved me twice."

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.700
"My life now belongs to you."

00:20:55.200 --> 00:21:02.100
"The reason why I'm having to write my words of appreciation is because our voices have been stolen by Thaegan,"

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.900
"Therefore, I cannot speak."

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:13.700
"When Thaegan transformed the beautiful city, D'Or, into the Lake of Tears, the Ralads voiced their protests."

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:18.750
"For that reason, Thaegan stole the Ralads' voices."

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:30.550
I bet Thaegan's going to realise soon that her children are dead.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:34.000
Let's head off now, then.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.700
Bye, Manus. Stay well!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.500
Don't go getting caught again.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.000
No, Kree.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.500
We already parted ways, remember?

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:46.150
Kree, that was some great work earlier!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:50.400
It's nice to have a reliable comrade like you. Don't you agree, Barda?

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.900
Yeah!

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:54.850
It's three against one.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.300
Okay, fine.

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:02.200
I didn't agree to it, but everyone wants you back!

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:07.300
<i>We still have only one gem.</i>

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:12.750
<i>Let's hurry and find the other six, together!</i>

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:14.500
Alright, let's go!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.900
Nij and Doj.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.100
A kind old couple.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:13.600
Except that they're actually two of Thaegan's children.

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:19.630
They lure travellers into their swamp, pretend to save them and then eat them.

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:26.900
We followed Manus and arrived in the city of the Ralads, but it was completely empty.

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:29.000
What's going on?

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.700
Where's the second gem?

00:24:30.700 --> 00:24:31.200
The Monster Living in the Lake of Tears

00:24:31.200 --> 00:24:34.580
Next time, 'The Monster Living in the Lake of Tears'.
